# Results and lemmas

Import WebProblem from "./web_problem.lg".
Import WebFormat from "./web_format.lg".

The verdicts the trusted verifier signed on a problem, and the lemma tree a
decomposition grew below it, each fetched when its section appears.

## To lemmaIndent (depth: Int) -> Text:
    Return "padding-left: {(depth - 1) * 20}px".

## Component ResultSection (pid: Text)

State:
    Let rows be a new Seq of ResultRow.

Actions:
    When this component appears:
        Get "/api/v1/problem/results?id=" + urlEncode(pid) as Seq of ResultRow, then arrived.

    To arrived (answer: Result of Seq of ResultRow and HttpError):
        Inspect answer:
            When Ok (list):
                Set rows to list.
            When Err (e):
                Set rows to a new Seq of ResultRow.

View:
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Verified results</h2>
      {for each r in rows, keyed by r's id:}
        <div class="result">
          <span class="verdict v-{r's verdictKind}">{r's verdictKind}</span> {r's subjectKind} by {r's verifier}, {formatStamp(r's createdAt)}
          <div class="hash">statement {shortHash(r's statementSha)} · document {shortHash(r's documentSha)} · toolchain {shortHash(r's toolchainSha)}</div>
        </div>
      {else:}
        <p class="empty" id="no-results">The verifier has signed nothing for this problem yet.</p>
      {end}
    </div>

## Component LemmaSection (pid: Text)

State:
    Let rows be a new Seq of LemmaRow.

Actions:
    When this component appears:
        Get "/api/v1/problem/lemmas?id=" + urlEncode(pid) as Seq of LemmaRow, then arrived.

    To arrived (answer: Result of Seq of LemmaRow and HttpError):
        Inspect answer:
            When Ok (list):
                Set rows to list.
            When Err (e):
                Set rows to a new Seq of LemmaRow.

View:
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Lemma tree</h2>
      <ul class="lemma-tree" id="lemmas">
        {for each l in rows, keyed by l's id:}
          <li style={lemmaIndent(l's depth)}><span class="dot s-{l's stage}"></span><span class="chip kind">{l's kind}</span>{l's label}</li>
        {else:}
          <li class="empty">No decomposition yet.</li>
        {end}
      </ul>
    </div>
